/ActualText (Social media platforms have become ubiquitous, fundamentally altering how we connect and interact. This pervasive influence necessitates a closer look at their impact on mental health. While social media fosters connection, self-expression, and community building, concerns regarding its potential to exacerbate anxiety, depression, and feelings of inadequacy are rising.)
