/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Really great full to work with such hard working team, everyone coordination is the result of the final product. I was completely new to the LLM, RAG space but i was able to learn everything from scratch starting with the what it is, how it is implemented and out of several ways to implement, found better ways from a great experimentation. Self learning on such regularly updating tech is hard but I enjoyed it.)
