291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Last Month On The Omdena Project Was Great! Every Day, I Looked Forward To Our Team Meetings. It Was Fun To Work With Such A Nice And Helpful Group. I Learned A Lot About Different Things, Like How Projects Are Planned \(Rag Pipeline\), How To Design User Interfaces \(Ui\), And How To Make Sure Ai Is Used Responsibly. There Were Some Tough Parts Too, But I Figured Them Out And Learned From Them. I'm Really Thankful For This Chance To Learn And Work With Others.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
