/T (I have thoroughly enjoyed working on this project. The hardwork really paid off and I am proud of what we have built as a team. I have learnt a lot from everyone who was a part of this project. I would also like to give a special thanks to Krishna Kishore Gajjala for his dedication in ensuring we got to the finish line.. Well done!)
/E (I have thoroughly enjoyed working on this project. The hardwork really paid off and I am proud of what we have built as a team. I have learnt a lot from everyone who was a part of this project. I would also like to give a special thanks to Krishna Kishore Gajjala for his dedication in ensuring we got to the finish line.. Well done!)
